WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.936
-Billy, you are up.
Come pull the mic.

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:04.770
Let's see what game you get,
please.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.439
-Let me pull this mic.
-Yes.

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:08.440
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, my God. I'mma sit.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.643
-Whoo!
-You were awesome.

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:14.447
-That's what I'm talking about.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:17.283
Musical Genre Challenge!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.284
-Okay!

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:22.956
-♪ Musical Genre Challenge ♪

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.457
-Now, here's how this works.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:25.958
You're gonna get a song title

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.960
and a totally different
musical genre,

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.964
then you have to sing that song
in that style.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.499
-Okay.
-Let's see what you get.

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.505
-"Stronger," Kelly Clarkson.

00:00:39.505 --> 00:00:41.340
Ooh!
-Oh, my goodness!

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:43.842
-Ooh, I kinda like this!
-Not fair!

00:00:43.842 --> 00:00:46.012
-I kinda like this combination.
-That's not fair.

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:49.182
-Gospel is my wheelhouse.
-I'm just gonna leave.

00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:51.151
-Yes!
-Oh!

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.954
-Billy's over there...
-Y'all ready to go to church?

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.088
[ Cheers and applause ]
-I am, actually.

00:00:56.088 --> 00:00:57.757
I'm ready. I'm ready.
-Oh, my God.

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:00.527
-Turn to your neighbor and say,
"Are you ready to go to church?"

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:03.029
-Are you ready to go to church?
-Oh, man, I'm ready. I'm ready.

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:05.865
-♪ You know the bed
feels warmer ♪

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:09.201
♪ Sleepin' here alone ♪

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:11.871
♪ You know I dream in color ♪

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:14.540
♪ And I do the things I want ♪

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:18.377
♪ You think you got
the best of me ♪

00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:22.215
♪ Think you have had
the last laugh ♪

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:29.622
♪ Bet you think that
everything good is gone ♪

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:33.125
♪ You think you left me
broken down ♪

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:35.461
♪ Think that I'll come ♪

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:36.896
♪ Running back ♪
-Yeah!

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:39.299
-♪ But, baby,
you don't know me ♪

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:43.636
♪ 'Cause you're dead wrong ♪

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:48.141
♪ What doesn't kill you
makes you stronger ♪

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:51.477
♪ Stand a little taller ♪

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:58.818
♪ Doesn't mean I'm lonely
when I'm alone ♪

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:02.488
♪ What doesn't kill you
makes a fighter ♪

00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:06.492
-♪ Ohhhh ♪
-♪ Footsteps even lighter ♪

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:09.262
♪ Doesn't mean I'm over ♪
-What is happening?!

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:13.766
-♪ Because you're gone ♪

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:17.103
♪ Oh, what doesn't kill you
makes you stronger, stronger ♪

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:21.273
♪ Oh, oh, makes you stronger ♪

00:02:21.273 --> 00:02:24.210
♪ I'm, I'm so much stronger ♪

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:28.047
[ Vocalizing ]

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:31.884
♪ Stro-o-o-o-onger ♪

00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:36.722
♪ Ohhh, baby, ay ♪

00:02:36.722 --> 00:02:46.732
♪ Just me, myself, and I ♪
-♪ Ahhhhh ♪

00:02:46.732 --> 00:02:52.171
Whoo!
-[ Vocalizing ]

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:56.008
♪ Yeaaaaaaah ♪

00:02:56.008 --> 00:02:59.512
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:02.181
-Oh, wow.
-Yeah!

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:04.016
-You know.
-Get outta here. Get outta here.

00:03:04.016 --> 00:03:05.885
-You can't take
the church out of me.

